<title>SPAIN: Revised Spanish M4 figures for April.</title>
<headline>Revised Spanish M4 figures for April.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain, which earlier released provisional M4 figures for May, subsequently published revised data as follows:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		   May 97     Apr 97	Mar 97</p>
<p> M4 pct rise		     8.5	  0.1	    2.6</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise   11.3	 10.8	   11.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Latest month's data are provisional. Previous are both revised. Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis.</p>
</text>
